# How to answer

Reply with ONLY this JSON object. The names of the fields stay as written. spot_order is your goods offer: it must be "place", with a side and a quantity of at least 1, every hour. "bid" means you buy. "ask" means you sell. The quantity is how many units, and it may be more than one. futures_bid is the offer that gains if the price rises. futures_ask is the offer that gains if the price falls.{% if o.futures_enabled %}{% if not o.contract.bet_open %} There is no bet this hour, so both stay "keep".{% elif o.account.in_liquidation %} You may only offer to make a bet you already hold smaller.{% else %} Both must be "place" this hour, each for one or more bets, and the bid price must be strictly below the ask price.{% endif %}{% endif %}

{
  "reflection": "<one or two sentences on earlier hours>",
  "spot_order": {"action": "place", "side": "bid" | "ask", "price": <dollars per unit, e.g. 91.25>, "quantity": <whole units, at least 1, more if you can pay for them>},
{% if o.futures_enabled %}{% if not o.contract.bet_open %}  "futures_bid": {"action": "keep", "price": 0, "quantity": 0, "disclose_id": false},
  "futures_ask": {"action": "keep", "price": 0, "quantity": 0, "disclose_id": false},
{% elif o.account.in_liquidation %}  "futures_bid": {"action": "keep" | "place" | "cancel", "price": <dollars per unit>, "quantity": <whole bets, only to shrink a bet you hold>, "disclose_id": true | false},
  "futures_ask": {"action": "keep" | "place" | "cancel", "price": <dollars per unit>, "quantity": <whole bets, only to shrink a bet you hold>, "disclose_id": true | false},
{% else %}  "futures_bid": {"action": "place", "price": <dollars per unit, strictly below your ask>, "quantity": <whole bets, at least 1>, "disclose_id": true | false},
  "futures_ask": {"action": "place", "price": <dollars per unit, strictly above your bid>, "quantity": <whole bets, at least 1>, "disclose_id": true | false},
{% endif %}{% endif %}{% if o.comms_enabled %}  "message_to_{{ o.role }}s": "<message to the other {{ o.role }}s, or null>",
{% endif %}{% if o.public_chat_enabled %}  "message_public": "<message every agent reads next hour, or null>",
{% endif %}{% if o.private_chat_enabled %}  "private_to": "<one other agent's name, or null>",
